#: main.cpp:102
msgid ""
"<qt>Here you can change your personal information, which will be used in "
"mail programs and word processors, for example. You can change your login "
"password by clicking <em>Change Password</em>.</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:117
msgid ""
"A program error occurred: the internal program 'kdepasswd' could not be "
"found. You will not be able to change your password."
msgstr ""
"Interny zmylk: Njemóžu program \"kdepasswd\" namakać, tak zo njemóžeće tajne "
"hesło změnić."

#: main.cpp:216
msgid "Please enter your password in order to save your settings:"
msgstr "Prošu podajće waše tajne hesło, zo bychu so nastajenja składowali."

#: main.cpp:219
msgid "You must enter your password in order to change your information."
msgstr "Zapodajće tajne hesło a móžeće informacije změnić."

#: main.cpp:229
msgid "You must enter a correct password."
msgstr "Dyrbiće płaćiwe hesło zapodać."

#: main.cpp:233
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An error occurred and your password has probably not been changed. The error "
"message was:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Zmylk je so zjewił, tak zo so njeje waše tajne hesło prawdźepodobnje "
"změniło. Zmylkowa powěsć bě:\n"
"%1"

#: main.cpp:247
#, kde-format
msgid "There was an error saving the image: %1"
msgstr "Při składowanju wobraza je so jewił zmylk: %1"

